M&A Step 6 — Institutional BD Layer 1

Status: Implemented as standalone module; partially wired relative to live scanner.

Current module:

`src/bve/intelligence/ma_bd_decomposition.py`

Purpose:

Convert BD logic into five institutional components:

```text
BD_M&A_score =
    0.30 × asset_quality
  + 0.20 × value_creation
  + 0.20 × transaction_timing
  + 0.25 × strategic_fit
  + 0.05 × deal_feasibility
```

1A — Asset quality:

```text
asset_quality =
    0.25 × clinical_evidence
  + 0.20 × differentiation
  + 0.15 × regulatory_path
  + 0.15 × ip_durability
  + 0.10 × cmc_feasibility
  + 0.15 × commercial_meaningfulness
```

Cap:

```text
if clinical_evidence < 0.35:
    asset_quality = min(asset_quality, 0.55)
```

1B — Value creation:

```text
value_creation =
    0.35 × premium_adjusted_rnpv_gap
  + 0.20 × synergy_upside
  + 0.15 × downside_protection
  + 0.15 × cost_to_complete
  + 0.15 × capital_solution_value
```

Guard:

```text
if asset_quality < 0.50:
    premium_adjusted_rnpv_gap_score is neutralized
```

1C — Transaction timing:

```text
transaction_timing =
    0.25 × financing_pressure
  + 0.25 × seller_willingness
  + 0.20 × transaction_window_quality
  + 0.15 × external_deal_activity
  + 0.15 × catalyst_setup
```

1D — Strategic fit:

```text
strategic_fit =
    0.20 × TA_fit
  + 0.15 × modality_fit
  + 0.20 × pipeline_gap_urgency
  + 0.15 × development_capability
  + 0.10 × commercial_capability
  + 0.10 × CMC_capability
  + 0.10 × relationship_control
```

1E — Deal feasibility:

```text
deal_feasibility =
    0.35 × affordability
  + 0.20 × antitrust_feasibility
  + 0.20 × asset_control
  + 0.15 × integration_feasibility
  + 0.10 × bidder_competition_risk_adjusted
```

Layer 1 gates:

| Gate | Trigger | Cap |
|---|---|---:|
| Broken asset | Asset quality < 0.35 | 0.40 |
| No right-to-win | Strategic fit < 0.45 | 0.55 |
| Poor value creation | Raw premium-adjusted rNPV gap < 0 | 0.60 |
| Low seller willingness | Seller willingness < 0.30 and financing pressure < 0.30 | 0.55 |
| Encumbrance | Asset control < 0.40 | 0.50 |

Current caveat:

This is a strong institutional decomposition, but it requires inputs that are not always available from public/config data.
For example, seller willingness, antitrust feasibility, exact asset control, and CMC buyer capability need expert diligence.

